: "1066255965785441", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1066255969118774_5061235754950637975_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gOIkKiJ3js4Q7kNvwFD5UGP&_nc_oc=AdoT--1ay3PubRTdLegfj-Fi4A7KxR9zEYkYz9fdHPW6RwqlTAtfu3jlXQ0eR4sxUDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNTaQrq0YzI8fgLdx-C9z6hTWCVgi4Qak4tcjgto10Aag&oe=6AC268CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumb_1.png", "id": "2197161320857639", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_2197161324190972_6772736704629114966_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yslm1q3A8_QQ7kNvwEu8qGa&_nc_oc=AdqLlyTablJ_waekXspzW89-dNFWTGpmG9_pa2haIZDfQqzrLpT2u4YR8Go_4caKxJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNgsOOGppj-CrpvdGTBtuhG_8F70ZQDqoBKUQWFn7TRog&oe=6AC264CC"}, "display_name": "Drug Dealing Simulator VR", "keywords": ["Drug", "Dealing", "Simulator", "Skateboard", "Schedule"], "long_description": "Travel around the town on your skateboard, **Rob people for money**, offer them **Free drugs**, hustle around the city, **Fight or escape cops**, **Grow weed/coca plants**, **Cook meth and Cocaine**, do chemical **Mixing**, **Invest** in properties, play in **Casino** or just do **Trash picking jobs**. The world is limitless\ud83c\udf3f\n{1610729873749072}\n# Ride around on your skateboard and organize your house and warehouse \ud83c\udfed\n{1410693714288820}\n# Plant seeds and water and harvest cannabis and coca trees. Run the lab to cook meth and process cocaine. Also, upgrade the lab to a warehouse with superior seeds and mixing for higher profits \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\udd2c\n{2128372754728929}\n# Increase your profit margins by extending your product with a variety of chemical additives and watch your customers react to your custom batches\ud83e\uddea\n{2141976119716074}\n\n\n{2478301776004449}\n\n\n- Find your Customers by **offering Free Drugs**\n